.TH TESSA 1 "2026-10-27" "Tessa 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tessa \- quiet tiled Wayland compositor and desktop shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tessa
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tessa
is a wlroots-based tiled Wayland compositor written in Zig. It provides a
taskbar, launcher, wallpaper, per-output workspaces, tiling layouts, window
rules, input modes, session locking, idle/output-power support, a clipboard
history, a screenshot UI, a StatusNotifier tray, and a process-based extension
API.
.PP
Start the compositor from an active logind seat, either from a TTY or through a
display-manager Wayland session. Do not run it as root. Quit with
.BR Super+Shift+E .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/tessa/config
Main configuration file. A commented example is installed at
.IR /usr/share/tessa/config.example .
.TP
.I ~/.config/tessa/outputs.conf
Saved output modes, positions, scales, transforms, and layout overrides.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TESSA_CONFIG
Override the configuration path.
.TP
.B TESSA_IPC
Override the IPC socket path.
.TP
.B TESSA_OUTPUT_CONFIG
Override the saved output configuration path.
.TP
.B TESSA_DEBUG
Set to any value for additional compositor logging.
.TP
.B WLR_BACKENDS
Select wlroots backends, for example
.BR drm ", " headless ", or " wayland .
.TP
.B WLR_RENDERER
Select a renderer such as
.BR gles2 " or " pixman .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tessa-ctl (1),
.BR tessa-panel (1),
.BR tessa-session (1)
.PP
Full documentation is installed under
.IR /usr/share/doc/tessa/ .
